  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>About BACRYLIX</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">BACRYLIX Nails is a premium press-on nail brand dedicated to bold design, flawless application, and salon-quality results—without the salon wait. Our sets are handcrafted with precision, trend-driven creativity, and durability in mind. We believe nails are a form of self-expression, confidence, and art.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We are currently seeking passionate, creative individuals to join our<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>BACRYLIX Brand Ambassador Team</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>and help us expand our community.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We’re searching for ambassadors who:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Love press-on nails, beauty, and nail art</p></li><li><p>Are active on Instagram, TikTok, or other social platforms</p></li><li><p>Create high-quality photos or videos (Reels, TikToks, Stories, etc.)</p></li><li><p>Align with the BACRYLIX aesthetic and brand values</p></li><li><p>Are enthusiastic, reliable, and professional</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><em>Follower count is not as important as engagement, creativity, and authenticity.</em></p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Ambassador Responsibilities</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">As a BACRYLIX Brand Ambassador, you will:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Create and post content featuring BACRYLIX nail sets</p></li><li><p>Tag @bacrylix and use branded hashtags in posts</p></li><li><p>Share honest reviews and application wear-time</p></li><li><p>Promote new launches, collections, or specials when requested</p></li><li><p>Represent BACRYLIX positively and professionally</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Posting frequency and expectations will be clearly communicated in advance.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Ambassador Perks</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Ambassadors will receive:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Complimentary BACRYLIX nail sets</p></li><li><p>Exclusive early access to new releases</p></li><li><p>Personal discount code for followers</p></li><li><p>Commission or store credit opportunities</p></li><li><p>Features on our website and social media</p></li><li><p>Long-term collaboration opportunities</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Top-performing ambassadors may be considered for<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>paid partnerships</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>or<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>custom collaboration sets</strong>.</p></div>",
